+# Generation prompts
+
+Built-in image_gen image editing; source gym4.png; final canvas 1672 × 941.
+Generated results are compositing sources. build_plates.py preserves source geometry and protects foreground equipment against generative omissions.
+
+## generated-day.png
+Use case: precise-object-edit. Edit the supplied gym photograph into a clean animation background plate. Preserve EXACT camera framing, perspective, geometry and placement of every remaining object. Output 1672x941 landscape. Remove ALL airborne volumetric sun rays, fog/haze and floating dust specks, especially the bright diagonal haze between left high windows and mirror. Keep warm late afternoon illumination on solid surfaces and keep ALL bright rectangular window sun patches on floor unchanged. Remove the athlete AND all barbells, weight plates and squat rack structures INSIDE the large mirror only; fill entire mirror with softly out of focus warm empty gym interior with architectural columns, high windows, distant indistinct equipment and hanging bulbs. Keep mirror frame and bottom metal frame. Remove ALL ceiling fan blades, leaving ONLY central motor and vertical suspension rod; reconstruct corrugated roof and structural rafters behind blades. Erase ALL handwriting and tally marks on whiteboard at right, leaving dirty wiped blank board surface; preserve frame, marker tray and markers. Preserve powerlifting poster, red yellow white signal lamps, wall lights, foreground barbells and weights, bench and floor exactly. No new objects. No text additions. This is an editing source for masked compositing, so absolute pixel alignment and unchanged framing are critical.
+
+## generated-shade.png
+Use case: lighting-weather. Edit this clean gym plate, preserving EXACT pixel coordinates, camera, all geometry, all objects and their shapes. Output 1672x941. Keep blank dirty whiteboard, bladeless ceiling fan motor and rod, empty softly blurred mirror with NO person, NO barbells, NO weight plates and NO squat rack. No airborne dust, haze or volumetric beams. Change to sun hidden behind a thick cloud. Remove ALL rectangular sun patches and direct sunlight on entire floor, walls, pillars and equipment. Floor must have uniform dark shaded illumination while preserving original slab seams and texture exactly. High windows stay bright with soft neutral overcast skylight. Wall tungsten lights and reflected hanging bulbs remain lit, red yellow white signal lights remain lit. No new objects, no changed framing. No remaining golden sunlight on floor or mirror.
+
+## generated-night.png
+Use case: lighting-weather. Edit this clean gym plate, preserving EXACT pixel coordinates, camera, all geometry, all objects and their shapes. Output 1672x941. Keep blank dirty whiteboard, bladeless ceiling fan motor and rod, empty softly blurred mirror with NO person, NO barbells, NO weight plates and NO squat rack. No airborne dust, haze or volumetric beams. Change to nighttime. High window glass is deep blue night, with visible original mullions. NO sunlight, NO floor window patches. All tungsten wall lamps and ceiling pendant bulbs on with warm yellow local glows on brick walls. Mirror dark and softly defocused, only a few warm bulb reflections, no bright window reflections. Red yellow and white three circular signal lamps under left poster are ALL OFF with dim dark tinted covers, no glow. Overall dark nighttime ambience with legible brick, roof and floor textures. Keep original geometry exactly.

